   "body": "Status (2026-10-29): the fix is **PR #315**, head `9eaffa7`. It is merged with `dev-swift` after #319, CI is green, CodeRabbit found nothing to change, and 1024 tests pass. All that is left is the cross-contributor **Fable** review (`REVIEW WANTED: fable` on #315), routed to Bybifok or Ezzz.\n\nThe reviewer gets only the diff, the PR's metadata lines, the LOT-043/048/051 specs, AGENTS.md, LESSONS.md and HFR-PROTOCOL.md. It must check that:\n- identity and token are compare-and-set in one actor turn;\n- a login adopted during the GET is really exercised by the tests;\n- no write uses a token from another identity.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
